div.p:
2. Have the Shah leave the country this weekend. There is concern that Khomeini
                    may at some point commit himself to trials if the Shah is permitted to leave the
                    country;

3. Call publicly for the embargo of all shipments to
                    Iran until the hostages are released, and ask other nations to support us in
                    this;

5. Mine Iranian ports and issue a statement that strong punishment will be
                    inflicted on Iran if any of the hostages are harmed; adding that the mining will
                    be lifted immediately once they are released;
